  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>For a light of wavelength&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math>, the fringe width in&nbsp;double slit experiment is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>For a light of wavelength&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>, the fringe width is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Divide equation (2) by equation (1) and simplify to obtain the fringe width for the later case.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mstyle></mfrac><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>Substitute the values of the known parameters into equation (3) to calculate the required fringe width.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>600</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>nm</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>nm</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p></blockquote>"
